      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildCSS": "Additionally, follow these instructions even if they contradict the above ones above:\n- Do NOT use separate file name. Put all css in a `<style>` tag in the head of the index.html file\n- Do NOT use relative units. Use px values.\n- You should generate both HTML and CSS at the same time\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
        "buildHTML": "Additionally, follow these instructions even if they contradict the above ones above:\n- Do not create a style.css file - put all css updates in a <style> tag in the head.\n- Do NOT use IDs or class on elements\n- Do NOT generate links or buttons\n- Generate both HTML and CSS at the same time\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
